special_name = "Beelzebuth"
special_description = "Basic: a Slime Blade that arcs with gravity and wind; press while it flies to recall it, and it flies straight back to him and can hit on the way. Each hit leaves a Predator Mark; three hits in a row burst for 12 more. Adaptation: every hit gives a stack (up to 3, +3% damage each), and a miss fades a stack and wipes his marks. Special: Beelzebuth throws a black orb that opens a devouring vortex where it lands, dragging the enemy in before it collapses for 38 (more with marks, which it eats). Below 40 HP he becomes the Shadow Sovereign: he rises into the air on great wings in his cracked mask, with faster Gluttony's Maw blades for 20, a recall hit slows the enemy's next throw, three marks snap shut for 20 and heal him 3, and Abyssal Adaptation stacks to 4 (+4% each). Beelzebuth hits for 44. Predator: when Beelzebuth hits, he devours their weapon and throws it at once as a free extra throw, 25% harder. Slime Regeneration: the first blow that would knock him out leaves him on 1 HP."
price = 1000
rarity = &"mythic"
